        },
        "renderShape": {
          "kind": "markdown"
        },
        "markdown": "# Blake Neff\n\nAmerican political writer and producer. A Dartmouth graduate, Neff worked in political journalism and became a top writer for **Tucker Carlson Tonight**. He resigned from Fox News in July 2020 after reporting connected him to racist, sexist, and homophobic anonymous forum posts. He later became a producer of **The Charlie Kirk Show** and, after Charlie Kirk’s death, a co-host of the continuing podcast.\n\nThis graph keeps independently documented career history separate from claims made in **Bride of Charlie**.",
        "view": {
          "intent": "graph",
